MASTER AESTHETIC & SYSTEM RULES FOR VAULT WORLDWIDE:
Full language: docs/LANGUAGE.md — portable BAD FORM canon (tokens, vetoes, SPECK save format, take/leave). Obey that file.
Overnight agent brief: docs/OVERNIGHT_PROMPT.md.
Product truth: PRODUCT.md. Visual system after build: DESIGN.md.

This is a paste-up studio: four tools as a fixed layout, not a dashboard, not a canvas OS, not stacked billboards.
The Manager is a paste-up **theatre** (section, not a boxed window): crop-mark frame, BOARD / REG plaques, RECORD, register targets, five hairline gutters, Archivo Narrow plaques, square waxed slabs. HIT a slab enters the **folio** (the job as a document; working light comes up). Nested work is sleek **boxed lines**, not unix stems, not mini-kanban. Pulled subtasks are slugs on slack tape; drop a slug on a parent card to dock it back. Directory is an elite TUI listing. No DateBlocks, no SaaS kanban chrome, no PM nest stems, no NEXUS HUD, no VU KPIs, no CRT wells.

PALETTE: Shop dimmer · mechanical white · tissue panel · process-black type · muted from ink · non-repro blue (register) · process red (select, leash taut, caret, URGENT, RECORD).
Process red is not harvest amber identity and not IMP `#E10600`. Cassette orange `#FF5C1A` is discarded. Cobalt has left. Charcoal cassette housing is discarded.

TYPE: Helvetica Neue / Helvetica / Arial on work. Archivo Narrow 700 on plaques (lane labels, project name, FIND). Job titles uppercase. Boxed lines sentence case. No JetBrains. No Space Grotesk. No Oswald.

COMPOSITION (desktop studio, not a PWA, not mobile-first):
1. Mechanical field. Deck fixed on top (BOARD + project window + RECORD, then five gutters or an entered folio), directory fixed under it, tissue scratch sidebar on the right (~320px). FIND is search only (top of the sidebar). Sections do not drag.
2. One work graph. Directory is the full unix catalogue (stems only). Manager shows jobs of one project plus loose satellites, or one entered folio. Nested (non-loose) children are boxed lines under the slab / in the folio. Ghost `+` in PENDING creates a job. `[+]` adds a boxed line.
3. Elite TUI directory: stems `│ ├── └──`, process-red name-block behind the live name. First click selects; second click / Enter renames. `ON` / drag stages onto the manager. Trailing `_` adds a child. TAB indent/outdent. Space is a silent stage shortcut. Stems never appear in the PM GUI. No boxed rows in the nest.
4. Scratch blocks snap-reorder vertically. Ghost `_ LINK` / `_ PIC` / `_ FILE` stay inert. Pointer `_` adds a note. Hitch is pointer. FIND does not create. No DOS `>` dock slab. No verb bar.
5. SPECK source is the save format (`speck-os-v2`). Statuses `pending|rnd|active|done|dusted|none`. `LOOSE` marks a pulled satellite. Physics A: card moves, nested follow, loose stay, leash sags and tightens. Dock back drops `LOOSE`.

HARD VETO: DateBlocks cards, jagged day cards, SaaS kanban chrome (avatars, KPIs, progress bars, “+ New Deal”), JSON-as-database, second prompt, cobalt lash, dump-parser dock, salt organs as identity (CAL / SEAL / SKULL), organ PLACE-drag, grain/scan as whole-OS overlay, 3D knobs, VU meters as KPIs, PM nest stems, unix-on-cards, boxed directory rows, rounded cards inside square wells, taut tuner-needle filaments, NEXUS HUD, five CRT wells.
Do not revive beige cassette as the OS identity, charcoal cassette housing, month-as-OS as home, paper/black IMP canvas, a Tailwind binder dashboard, BLACK LANTERN as maker, or a sit-down verb codebook.
